WEBVTT

00:07.230 --> 00:10.190
Shigeo, wait! Remain calm!

00:10.190 --> 00:12.150
Look into my eyes!

00:13.840 --> 00:17.400
I can tell these aren't real bodies!

00:17.400 --> 00:19.080
They're dummies!

00:19.390 --> 00:22.290
Some esper probably
put them here to fool you!

00:23.330 --> 00:24.860
Come on, Dimple.

00:24.860 --> 00:27.100
Does a psychic power like that really exist?

00:27.100 --> 00:30.880
J-Just think about everything you've seen!
It's completely possible!

00:30.880 --> 00:32.880
No, I know it's out there!

00:40.370 --> 00:41.310
I found them.

00:41.310 --> 00:43.600
Did he just learn how to do that?

00:44.140 --> 00:45.560
That's gotta be our guy!

00:45.860 --> 00:46.810
Dimple...

00:48.660 --> 00:51.280
Thank you for stopping me.

00:52.140 --> 00:55.490
We can't relax just yet.
We're going after them, aren't we?

00:55.750 --> 00:59.450
Of course. I'm going to get all
three of them back right now.

01:00.050 --> 01:02.100
Whoever did this won't get away with it.

01:02.100 --> 01:04.540
No matter how far they run,
I will make them pay.

01:04.500 --> 01:05.870
Obsession

01:08.290 --> 01:10.750
Kill

01:08.290 --> 01:10.750
Is there a point to setting the place on fire?

01:11.010 --> 01:14.010
Makes it obvious that it's been dealt with.

01:16.470 --> 01:17.130
What was that?

01:17.130 --> 01:17.860
A meteor?

01:17.860 --> 01:19.760
Who the hell is that?

01:26.530 --> 01:29.390
(Get ready, wake your psyche up, MOB!)

01:29.390 --> 01:32.200
(Get ready, dig your anger up, MOB!)

01:32.200 --> 01:35.050
(Get ready, wake your psyche up, MOB!)

01:35.050 --> 01:36.110
(Get ready!)

01:37.010 --> 01:41.700
Coming down, could you fill your satisfaction?

01:42.760 --> 01:47.440
You're a MOB. Can't you feel your own frustration?

01:48.470 --> 01:53.190
Coming down, could you fill your satisfaction?

01:54.210 --> 01:57.750
You're a MOB. What do you want to be?

01:57.750 --> 02:04.290
Wear your overflowing emotions on your sleeve and break it down.

02:05.510 --> 02:09.190
What do you see once you go beyond your limits?

02:09.190 --> 02:12.170
(99.9! 99.9!)

02:12.170 --> 02:15.050
The mysterious percentage.

02:16.730 --> 02:19.520
Cryin' my life, cryin' my psyche,

02:19.520 --> 02:22.470
cryin' my heart in such commonplaces!

02:22.470 --> 02:25.300
Is that your ideal? Is that your mind?

02:25.300 --> 02:28.210
It all begins when it hits 100.

02:28.210 --> 02:31.000
The MOB is alive. The MOB is high.

02:31.000 --> 02:33.890
The MOB is staying frustrated, aren't you?

02:33.890 --> 02:38.280
Is that your ideal? Is that your mind? Right now...

02:39.600 --> 02:40.820
Your life is your own.

02:40.820 --> 02:43.590
(Get ready, wake your psyche up, MOB!)

02:43.260 --> 02:48.100
Mob Psycho

02:43.590 --> 02:46.480
(Get ready, dig your anger up, MOB!)

02:46.480 --> 02:49.350
(Get ready, wake your psyche up, MOB!)

02:49.350 --> 02:50.660
(Get ready!)

02:53.020 --> 02:58.030
Show Me What You've Got
~Band Together~

03:07.070 --> 03:10.120
You're Hanazawa Teruki... aren't you?

03:10.390 --> 03:13.380
Hanazawa? Oh, the guy that lives downsta—

03:13.380 --> 03:14.590
Telekinetic Explosion!

03:20.640 --> 03:22.050
I know you.

03:22.050 --> 03:25.280
You're our target.

03:25.280 --> 03:28.310
How the hell did you find out about us?

03:28.510 --> 03:31.230
Well, whatever. You can die here.

03:34.840 --> 03:37.780
Wow, looks like you're somewhat resilient.

03:41.530 --> 03:43.530
Where'd you take my family?

03:43.530 --> 03:45.190
This is great.

03:45.190 --> 03:49.500
Let's see if you die from
electrocution first or I just bite it!

03:49.690 --> 03:53.120
I'm not interested.
Use something other than electricity.

03:55.530 --> 03:57.750
Wait, is that all you can do?

03:57.750 --> 03:59.130
You're free to go.

04:03.090 --> 04:06.390
Maybe you're the guy, then.

04:06.390 --> 04:08.140
Show me your powers!

04:09.270 --> 04:11.170
You've got a lousy attitude, kid.

04:11.170 --> 04:16.110
If you want to see my powers
so badly, I'll show you!

04:19.680 --> 04:22.030
They're fighting! Some old guy
and a middle school kid!

04:22.030 --> 04:25.310
I have impregnable armor
made out of energy.

04:25.750 --> 04:29.580
And I beat the crap out of my enemies.
That's my style.

04:30.460 --> 04:31.660
Seriously...

04:32.190 --> 04:34.540
Could you guys quit wasting my time?

04:34.540 --> 04:37.100
Looks like you have a decent barrier.

04:37.100 --> 04:39.250
Is that your power?!

04:40.750 --> 04:42.290
Quit messing with me!

04:45.390 --> 04:49.120
I want to see this power
that can create dummies!

04:49.120 --> 04:51.100
Why did you attack my house?!

04:51.100 --> 04:52.810
Someone call an ambulance and the police!

04:52.810 --> 04:55.660
You've got the wrong idea...

04:55.660 --> 05:00.610
We were on our way
to attack your house...

05:01.230 --> 05:02.030
What?

05:02.490 --> 05:05.270
Hey! Who said you could pass out?!

05:05.270 --> 05:05.990
Hey!

05:06.360 --> 05:07.200
Damn it...

05:09.200 --> 05:11.630
I've contacted the upper echelon.

05:11.630 --> 05:16.630
Now you're totally screw... ed.

05:17.230 --> 05:21.430
This isn't good, Shigeo.
Seems there're more espers on the way.

05:21.430 --> 05:22.300
We need to—

05:22.300 --> 05:25.010
I haven't gotten any information yet, though.

05:25.530 --> 05:28.840
If they have more friends coming,
I'll just have to ask them.

05:31.700 --> 05:32.770
An umbrella?

05:38.160 --> 05:40.830
Hey, you little shit. You in trouble?

05:43.140 --> 05:44.820
Chill with the murderous vibe back there.

05:45.030 --> 05:48.280
Former Claw
7th Division Member
Koyama

05:45.130 --> 05:47.970
We're not trying to start
any trouble with you.

05:48.540 --> 05:49.280
Right?

05:49.490 --> 05:52.450
Former Claw
7th Division Member

05:49.490 --> 05:52.450
Sakurai

05:49.580 --> 05:52.580
If you have any questions,
I'll answer them for you, kid.

05:52.830 --> 05:56.040
My family's wherever
you're taking me, aren't they?

05:56.190 --> 05:58.620
Your family? No, they aren't.

06:00.460 --> 06:03.000
Then I have no reason to go. Let me out.

06:03.180 --> 06:06.510
Hang on! Your friends and master
are waiting there!

06:06.510 --> 06:07.880
Reigen's there?

06:07.880 --> 06:10.210
In that case, we need to hurry!

06:10.210 --> 06:11.800
Yo, yo, wait, wait!

06:11.800 --> 06:13.510
Don't be crazy!

06:20.530 --> 06:22.160
Ugh, I'm going to throw up...

06:22.710 --> 06:24.900
But we managed to shake anyone
who was tailing us.

06:25.800 --> 06:27.700
We brought him.

06:27.700 --> 06:29.260
Here's Kageyama Shigeo.

06:29.660 --> 06:31.810
Long time no see, kid.

06:32.300 --> 06:34.620
You haven't let yourself go, have you?

06:34.620 --> 06:38.500
I know we used to be rivals,
but I look forward to working with you...

06:38.940 --> 06:41.330
What the hell kind of gathering is this?

06:42.410 --> 06:44.090
Mob, are you all right?

06:44.500 --> 06:45.580
Master...

06:46.110 --> 06:49.050
My home... My family...

06:49.310 --> 06:51.010
Go on, but have a seat.

06:51.480 --> 06:54.720
I'll actually explain everything
in Shigeo's place.

06:55.220 --> 06:57.560
Currently explaining the situation

06:57.690 --> 06:58.860
I see.

06:59.420 --> 07:01.560
Dimple, I need to talk to you for a sec.

07:01.740 --> 07:02.490
Sure.

07:04.260 --> 07:07.100
Did you just panic and lie
about the dummies?

07:07.100 --> 07:09.850
Kinda, but I do have reasons to believe it.

07:09.850 --> 07:12.380
You must've really been panicking.

07:12.380 --> 07:15.270
If Mob finds out you lied,
he's going to hate you forever.

07:17.100 --> 07:18.950
Mob, I need to talk to you.

07:19.630 --> 07:21.820
Are you going to tell him? Hang on a sec!

07:21.820 --> 07:23.500
If he learns the truth...

07:24.220 --> 07:26.680
Mob, your family...

07:28.510 --> 07:30.670
I think they're safe, too.

07:32.360 --> 07:35.410
Those guys were still on the way
to your house, right?

07:35.410 --> 07:38.970
Someone must've known what
was going on and saved them.

07:39.540 --> 07:41.400
They started the fire
and made them look dead

07:41.400 --> 07:43.500
so they wouldn't be targeted anymore.

07:44.170 --> 07:45.140
Isn't that great?

07:53.960 --> 07:56.460
The moment he relaxed, he fell fast asleep.

07:57.230 --> 07:59.410
Now it's your turn to talk.

08:00.130 --> 08:02.830
What the hell brought you lot together?

08:02.830 --> 08:04.380
Aren't these guys from Claw?!

08:04.380 --> 08:08.090
Former Claw
7th Division Member
Tsuchiya

08:04.600 --> 08:08.500
Us members of the 7th Division left Claw.

08:08.980 --> 08:11.720
After being annihilated
by a group of middle school kids,

08:10.090 --> 08:13.800
Former Claw
7th Division Member
Mukai

08:11.720 --> 08:14.090
we realized just how foolish we were.

08:14.090 --> 08:17.850
Mole

08:14.220 --> 08:17.850
Former Claw 7th Division Member
Muraki

08:14.310 --> 08:18.700
And now, we're all trying to start a new life.

08:19.210 --> 08:21.010
Following Master Reigen's example,

08:21.010 --> 08:24.440
we're trying to find a way to use
our powers for the good of society.

08:24.880 --> 08:27.860
But the organization doesn't let traitors go.

08:28.060 --> 08:30.980
We figured they'd come after us
sooner rather than later,

08:30.980 --> 08:33.070
but this was a lot faster
than we anticipated.

08:33.070 --> 08:36.240
Former Claw
7th Division Member
Terada

08:33.320 --> 08:36.780
And they launched attacks on all of us
at the same time.

08:37.220 --> 08:38.660
I'm impressed you survived that.

08:38.830 --> 08:42.570
Who do you think we are?
We're former Scars.

08:42.570 --> 08:44.030
Right, Tsucchi?

08:44.030 --> 08:48.380
Yeah. But the real battle will begin
after the guys from HQ show up.

08:48.550 --> 08:50.500
And then, we realized that

08:50.500 --> 08:54.590
we're going to need a leader
if we want to stand a chance against HQ.

08:54.590 --> 08:58.550
And so, they came to me.

08:58.550 --> 09:00.310
You should probably shut up for a bit.

09:00.760 --> 09:03.940
When we saw Master Reigen put
the TV and media people in their place,

09:03.940 --> 09:05.890
we thought he was a genius.

09:06.090 --> 09:10.610
He's able to see the bigger picture
and make things happen.

09:11.020 --> 09:14.070
I seriously don't know about these guys...

09:14.640 --> 09:16.780
You didn't get attacked?

09:17.170 --> 09:18.870
My office was destroyed.

09:19.470 --> 09:23.250
I just happened to be away
when it happened, thankfully.

09:24.200 --> 09:26.380
Since I gained popularity
from my TV appearances,

09:26.380 --> 09:28.160
I thought I could get some renovations done.

09:28.920 --> 09:30.920
That's my office.

09:30.920 --> 09:33.920
Spirits and Such Consultation Office

09:32.520 --> 09:33.920
It's on fire...

09:34.900 --> 09:37.630
But that's going to have to wait.

09:37.950 --> 09:41.260
After that, these guys picked me up.

09:41.260 --> 09:43.530
I was already exhausted from the marathon.

09:43.530 --> 09:45.390
Talk about a crappy day.

09:46.110 --> 09:48.600
I wonder if Teru-san's okay.

09:48.600 --> 09:52.110
Oh, I got a message from him earlier.
He said he's fine.

09:52.110 --> 09:55.070
They exchanged emails

09:52.290 --> 09:53.560
When'd that happen?

09:53.560 --> 09:55.070
This sucks...

09:55.580 --> 09:57.280
What are you guys doing here?

09:57.480 --> 10:01.270
We're trying to lay low after what
happened with the 7th Division.

10:01.270 --> 10:04.200
Mitsuura-san prepared this hideout for us.

10:04.200 --> 10:09.020
So many espers in one spot! I'm so moved!

10:09.420 --> 10:10.300
Oh, him.

10:12.540 --> 10:13.840
Teru-san!

10:14.550 --> 10:17.290
Heya. Looks like the gang's all here.

10:19.190 --> 10:19.970
You fools!

10:20.330 --> 10:24.130
You'll never get a word out of me!

10:24.380 --> 10:25.560
I'm a member of Cla—

10:27.610 --> 10:31.900
Resistance is futile.
No one's been able to endure this torture.

10:33.410 --> 10:35.440
Sorry! I'll talk!

10:35.740 --> 10:39.440
The boss was going around the world
to scout powerful espers,

10:39.440 --> 10:42.410
and he said he finally had
all the soldiers he needed!

10:42.890 --> 10:47.160
I see... Espers from around the world, eh?

10:47.590 --> 10:52.470
Don't tell me you fools still plan
to face us after hearing that...

10:53.690 --> 10:56.340
What shall we do, Master Reigen?

10:57.950 --> 11:00.200
Well, we can't just let this slide.

11:00.800 --> 11:02.960
Let's report them to the police.

11:12.830 --> 11:14.270
Isn't it amazing?

11:14.520 --> 11:18.190
Claw Foreigner Squad
Joseph

11:15.080 --> 11:18.490
Ordinary humans actually made all of this.

11:18.640 --> 11:22.170
I'm so excited.
I can't wait to destroy it all.

11:18.740 --> 11:22.410
Claw Foreigner Squad

11:18.740 --> 11:22.410
Udo

11:22.170 --> 11:24.830
That's why we came to this country, right?

11:24.830 --> 11:26.130
Really?

11:26.660 --> 11:28.230
I came here for the money.

11:36.130 --> 11:37.590
Mob Psycho

11:38.510 --> 11:39.500
Ladies and gentlemen,

11:40.090 --> 11:43.680
Claw

11:40.520 --> 11:43.680
I thank you all for gathering
on this memorable day.

11:44.120 --> 11:47.820
I am the leader of Claw,
Suzuki Toichiro.

11:45.180 --> 11:48.140
Claw Boss
Suzuki Toichiro (46)

11:48.530 --> 11:53.350
Let's not waste any time.
We are about to declare war on the world.

11:53.950 --> 11:58.450
After twenty years, I finally have
the funds and manpower that I need.

11:58.780 --> 12:01.420
We will begin this revolution
with destruction.

11:58.780 --> 12:01.990
Claw

12:01.810 --> 12:05.320
We will destroy everything
that people built and hold dear.

12:05.870 --> 12:10.280
Let us show the powerless that we exist!

12:10.280 --> 12:12.000
Yeah!

12:12.000 --> 12:15.540
World domination, eh?
Well, isn't that ambitious?

12:16.000 --> 12:17.560
Are all the preparations complete?

12:17.560 --> 12:19.760
Oh, I don't even need to prepare.

12:19.760 --> 12:22.300
Claw

12:22.660 --> 12:23.790
What are they doing?

12:23.790 --> 12:24.720
Is that TV?

12:29.520 --> 12:31.890
Now you're live on all channels.

12:32.020 --> 12:37.610
Ultimate 5
Hatori

12:32.490 --> 12:35.390
The ability to infiltrate and
control any kind of system

12:35.390 --> 12:38.460
dealing with electronic devices or waves.

12:38.460 --> 12:41.400
He doesn't actually understand
how it works, either.

12:41.640 --> 12:43.990
He's good...

12:43.990 --> 12:48.000
We are esper organization Claw.

12:48.410 --> 12:51.420
We have taken over the airwaves
with our psychic powers.

12:51.420 --> 12:55.330
This is a mere fraction of our true power.

12:55.800 --> 12:59.170
Our powers are far superior
to modern weaponry.

12:59.460 --> 13:02.670
Let me warn you that
it's not advisable to oppose us.

13:03.090 --> 13:05.930
We will control the world with psychic powers

13:05.930 --> 13:06.010
Another esper?
Too many espers lolololol

13:05.930 --> 13:06.010
He's cray

13:05.930 --> 13:09.640
and rule over all of the powerless.

13:06.010 --> 13:06.550
What the hell is "Claw"?

13:06.010 --> 13:06.550
Claw lolololol Edgy much? Lololololol

13:06.550 --> 13:06.890
Apparently his brain stopped developing when he was a kid

13:06.550 --> 13:06.890
Okay, well I'm gonna be a superhero then

13:06.890 --> 13:07.470
Talk about lame

13:06.890 --> 13:07.470
This shit again? So boring

13:07.470 --> 13:07.890
I could probably take him in one punch

13:07.470 --> 13:07.890
You may be a claw, but I'm just a toenail

13:07.890 --> 13:09.640
Maki Maki
Oh, shit.
It's the end of the world lolololol
Yukki
lolololololol Read
Maki Maki
Edgelord lol
Who the hell is that?
Yukki
Hell if I know lolol Read

13:09.890 --> 13:13.980
The first step in our mission
is to demolish this country.

13:14.400 --> 13:16.730
A new world is about to begin.

13:17.090 --> 13:19.210
Look forward to it.

13:23.240 --> 13:26.530
Now you've done it, you piece of shit dad!

13:27.090 --> 13:29.700
How dare you embarrass me like that again?!

13:29.740 --> 13:33.790
Fukuda

13:29.740 --> 13:33.790
Otsuki

13:29.740 --> 13:33.790
Higashio

13:30.510 --> 13:32.550
I'm the one who's going to defeat him!

13:32.550 --> 13:33.790
You got that, Ritsu?!

13:34.010 --> 13:34.670
Yeah.

13:34.670 --> 13:36.420
All right! Let's go!

13:36.420 --> 13:37.500
Hang on a sec.

13:37.500 --> 13:40.250
What? You're still not on board?

13:40.640 --> 13:42.500
What about my family's safety?

13:42.890 --> 13:48.050
Oh, we have a set of eyes
on your parents from afar.

13:48.470 --> 13:49.660
See?

13:50.990 --> 13:54.640
We said that you, because you wanted
to do something nice for your parents,

13:54.640 --> 13:57.350
Hot Springs Hotel Voucher

13:54.970 --> 13:57.340
entered a hot springs hotel lottery and won,

13:57.610 --> 13:59.350
and they totally fell for that lie.

13:59.350 --> 14:01.900
You were really pushing it with that ad-lib.

14:02.840 --> 14:06.360
That hot springs hotel doesn't have ties
to some shady organization, does it?

14:06.360 --> 14:10.070
Streaming data

14:06.360 --> 14:10.070
Don't worry. They offer both
traditional seafood and farm meat meals,

14:10.290 --> 14:12.990
and they're happy to accommodate
any allergies, too.

14:12.990 --> 14:15.130
That's not what I'm talking about!

14:15.900 --> 14:19.440
Anyway, my brother's
still not answering his phone.

14:20.070 --> 14:22.460
Your brother's not going to fight.

14:23.020 --> 14:24.250
I could tell from his eyes.

14:24.540 --> 14:27.450
He's not the type to blow up
without a real good reason.

14:28.580 --> 14:30.910
I think I gave him a pretty good one, though.

14:30.910 --> 14:34.220
What? Did you do something
after we left the house?

14:34.930 --> 14:38.380
If you did something that
really pissed my brother off,

14:38.380 --> 14:39.770
you're in big trouble.

14:41.130 --> 14:43.720
Guess you've had a hard life, too.

14:44.110 --> 14:47.860
600 people

14:45.360 --> 14:47.860
I will now explain the plan
that the boss was talking about.

14:47.860 --> 14:52.200
Claw 1st Division Leader
Tamaki

14:48.920 --> 14:52.910
In Japan, the number of policemen
and military personnel who have guns

14:52.910 --> 14:54.990
total roughly 600,000.

14:55.790 --> 15:00.210
Meanwhile, our forces number around 600.

14:58.620 --> 15:00.210
600 people

15:00.850 --> 15:05.340
Each one will have to face
about a thousand in battle.

15:03.000 --> 15:05.340
600,000

15:05.890 --> 15:07.430
That shouldn't be a problem, right?

15:08.400 --> 15:09.350
That's awesome!

15:09.350 --> 15:10.420
That's our boss!

15:10.420 --> 15:12.010
Who knew it'd be so easy?

15:12.010 --> 15:14.540
This actually seems possible all of a sudden.

15:15.870 --> 15:18.410
Can you even call that a plan?

15:18.410 --> 15:20.520
It doesn't seem very likely to work.

15:20.690 --> 15:22.980
This lot is hopeless.

15:23.750 --> 15:25.940
What are you thinking, Joseph?

15:26.300 --> 15:28.280
Probably the same as you guys.

15:28.580 --> 15:33.500
According to his logic, if each
of us defeat about 120 people,

15:31.950 --> 15:34.370
Foreigner Squad

15:31.950 --> 15:34.370
People

15:31.950 --> 15:34.370
People

15:33.500 --> 15:35.200
we can destroy Claw.

15:35.570 --> 15:38.330
We're going to start a mutiny?
That sounds fun.

15:38.330 --> 15:41.790
Yes! I don't care what we do
as long as I get to break stuff!

15:42.120 --> 15:45.750
First, we need to make an example
of the upper echelon.

15:47.240 --> 15:48.210
What?

15:48.680 --> 15:50.860
You're going to destroy this organization?

15:49.970 --> 15:54.220
Claw 1st~6th Division Leaders

15:51.140 --> 15:54.220
You're going to give up future glory
for the sake of money?

15:54.220 --> 15:58.680
You vile creatures.
I'll take care of you myself.

15:58.680 --> 16:00.350
Come at me all at once.

16:06.590 --> 16:07.450
Teehee.

16:07.820 --> 16:11.700
I'm gonna punch you now,
so I hope you can put up a barrier.

16:12.350 --> 16:15.210
Claw, a dangerous esper organization, huh?

16:15.580 --> 16:18.860
For something you've been plotting for
twenty years, it sure is full of holes.

16:19.620 --> 16:23.110
Does an elephant that's about
to crush a thousand ants

16:23.110 --> 16:25.170
have much to worry about?

16:26.370 --> 16:28.690
I'm really starting to feel sorry for you.

16:28.690 --> 16:31.580
You have no idea the Japanese government
already had their eyes on you,

16:31.580 --> 16:34.430
nor who the person in front of you is.

16:35.140 --> 16:39.180
So you were sent by the government?

16:39.180 --> 16:40.680
Just me, yeah.

16:40.680 --> 16:43.860
But I managed to get other guys on board.

16:43.860 --> 16:46.310
This organization will implode
before this terrorist plot.

16:46.750 --> 16:48.240
Claw is finished.

16:48.770 --> 16:49.730
Hey, now.

16:50.110 --> 16:53.650
You were lying to President Suzuki?

16:53.650 --> 16:55.910
How could you do something so awful?!

16:56.560 --> 16:57.750
White Noise!

17:06.250 --> 17:09.420
It looks like it'd be hard
to move around in that.

17:10.700 --> 17:13.100
Once it hardens, it's as hard as steel.

17:13.100 --> 17:14.890
Anyone who gets caught in that is finished.

17:16.410 --> 17:17.260
Miguel!

17:18.030 --> 17:21.720
You said you felt sorry for me
a moment ago, didn't you?

17:22.210 --> 17:25.460
But now, I feel sorry for you.

17:28.050 --> 17:31.900
Could you not give me more work to do?

17:30.320 --> 17:32.990
Ultimate 5
Minegishi

17:34.300 --> 17:35.910
Well, this is pathetic.

17:35.910 --> 17:38.160
These guys are supposed to
be in our upper echelon.

17:38.610 --> 17:40.620
Look at them.

17:40.930 --> 17:43.290
D-Damn it!

17:45.750 --> 17:49.210
Shibata
Ultimate 5

17:45.900 --> 17:48.800
I see you're the same type as me.

17:51.020 --> 17:55.130
The loss of my division leaders
won't be enough for Claw to implode.

17:55.420 --> 17:58.340
I've dubbed Claw's main force the Ultimate 5.

17:58.340 --> 18:00.350
As long as the Ultimate 5 and I are around,

18:00.350 --> 18:02.310
Claw is invincible.

18:02.600 --> 18:03.900
I'm not done yet!

18:03.900 --> 18:05.570
I can at least take you out here!

18:07.780 --> 18:08.770
What?!

18:13.960 --> 18:15.460
Well done.

18:15.460 --> 18:19.370
I knew it'd be a waste to let you
continue being a shut-in.

18:19.620 --> 18:23.950
Ultimate 5
Serizawa

18:19.630 --> 18:23.950
Yes, sir! It's all thanks to you that
I was able to step back into society!

18:23.950 --> 18:27.410
By the way, where's Shimazaki?
I haven't seen him.

18:28.080 --> 18:31.110
I'm having him take care
of something else for me.

18:35.590 --> 18:36.840
Damn them...

18:37.180 --> 18:38.840
They're a bigger threat than we thought.

18:39.800 --> 18:42.260
I had the best chefs prepare this meal!

18:42.420 --> 18:43.810
Eat as much as you'd like!

18:44.420 --> 18:47.370
I'm surprised HQ hasn't attacked yet.

18:47.370 --> 18:50.520
I mean, we could strike first,
but considering our numbers...

18:51.020 --> 18:54.290
Well, Kageyama-kun and I
are worth at least a thousand people.

18:54.290 --> 18:57.190
Either way, nothing's starting
until the kid wakes up.

18:57.520 --> 19:00.480
Stop eating all the roast beef, mohawk!

19:00.480 --> 19:01.910
There's a limit of three per person!

19:01.910 --> 19:02.540
Huh?

19:02.540 --> 19:04.850
Apologize to Master Reigen, Koyama!

19:04.850 --> 19:06.160
Lay the hell off!

19:06.510 --> 19:09.420
They didn't see the message on TV.

19:11.500 --> 19:12.620
So yes,

19:12.630 --> 19:16.340
On Women's Empowerment
Lecturer: Prime Minister Yabe Hiroshi

19:12.920 --> 19:16.070
by providing women more opportunities
to start their own business

19:16.070 --> 19:19.840
and expanding the range of childcare welfare,

19:20.560 --> 19:23.850
we can provide solutions to
sexual and authority harassment...

19:26.180 --> 19:28.110
Nice to meet you, Prime Minister.

19:28.060 --> 19:33.730
Ultimate 5
Shimazaki

19:28.320 --> 19:32.990
I'm a member of Claw, who last night
declared they'd be taking over the world.

19:32.990 --> 19:36.690
I've come to abduct you today.

19:40.770 --> 19:42.240
Prime Minister, please come this way!

19:42.240 --> 19:43.550
Who the hell do you think you are?

19:43.550 --> 19:46.640
Hey, by the way, are you
broadcasting this on TV?

19:43.580 --> 19:44.200
Damn it!

19:44.200 --> 19:45.200
Shut up!

19:45.580 --> 19:46.640
Don't move!

19:46.640 --> 19:49.740
I sure hope we end up on breaking news.

19:49.740 --> 19:52.280
Stop! Don't move!

19:52.600 --> 19:53.330
Does he have a gun?

19:53.330 --> 19:54.290
Freeze!

19:56.240 --> 19:57.000
You missed.

20:02.630 --> 20:05.420
The thing is, even though I can't see,

20:05.420 --> 20:07.900
I can predict people's movements.

20:08.620 --> 20:11.350
But even if I'm hit, I really
have nothing to worry about.

20:13.490 --> 20:14.610
See?

20:17.280 --> 20:22.880
Prime Minister, let me fill you in
on what my other special power is.

20:22.880 --> 20:24.110
You see...

20:25.660 --> 20:27.110
I can teleport.

20:28.870 --> 20:30.640
Why are you kidnapping me?

20:30.640 --> 20:33.210
What do you plan to do with me?

20:33.380 --> 20:35.540
Nothing complicated. You're just a hostage.

20:35.700 --> 20:39.320
Are you serious about
this world domination crap?

20:39.320 --> 20:41.870
Oh, yes. Very much so.

20:47.380 --> 20:49.430
And who might you be?

20:49.680 --> 20:51.560
I saw the broadcast and rushed here,

20:51.560 --> 20:53.850
and then I sensed you two in this park.

20:54.340 --> 20:57.470
If you think everything in life
goes as planned,

20:58.300 --> 21:00.480
let me teach you a lesson
by taking you down.

21:00.820 --> 21:05.030
What a funny thing to say.
I guess you can try.

21:06.400 --> 21:07.570
Telekinetic Explosion!

21:09.080 --> 21:10.170
Air Whips!

21:13.310 --> 21:14.290
He disappeared?

21:15.450 --> 21:17.890
What? I was too careless!

21:18.210 --> 21:19.940
Pyrokinesis!

21:26.520 --> 21:28.050
I lost sight of him again.

21:28.520 --> 21:30.220
Is this guy's power...

21:30.810 --> 21:32.330
Over here.

21:41.510 --> 21:43.210
Super speed movement?

21:43.210 --> 21:44.740
In that case...

21:45.120 --> 21:46.660
Multi-Layer Barrier!

21:48.450 --> 21:51.330
My new technique where I
overlap multiple barriers...

21:52.030 --> 21:54.000
While the enemy's trying to get through,

21:54.000 --> 21:55.280
the others should get here.

21:55.830 --> 21:58.040
Well, aren't you multi-talented.

22:04.220 --> 22:05.400
That quick?

22:06.110 --> 22:08.140
Thanks for entertaining me.

22:19.130 --> 22:21.510
Hanazawa! Hey! Wake up!

22:21.510 --> 22:24.180
Why the hell'd you run off on your own?!

22:36.720 --> 22:41.750
I spilled a seed and lost sight of it

22:45.460 --> 22:50.760
I'll find it using the color it's dyed in and watch it grow

22:53.100 --> 22:59.230
It immediately returned to the palm of my hand

22:59.230 --> 23:08.800
But it's still too light and too frail to reach for the skies

23:09.860 --> 23:14.420
The world coldly drains away all the heat

23:14.420 --> 23:18.970
The bright sunshine just isn't enough

23:18.970 --> 23:23.360
The memories are closing off what lies ahead

23:23.360 --> 23:28.460
Shake off their warmth and set off into the distance

23:29.720 --> 23:35.220
If I let it wither, it'd be over just like that

23:35.220 --> 23:40.510
But my hope just doesn't fade away

23:55.720 --> 23:58.250
The main force of Claw,
the Ultimate 5, terrorize Seasoning City.

23:58.250 --> 24:01.210
Meanwhile, the esper squad and
the boss's son, Sho, make their moves.

24:01.210 --> 24:02.920
Mob, this is no time to be sleeping!

24:02.920 --> 24:05.040
Next time on Mob Psycho 100 II Episode 10:

24:05.040 --> 24:06.580
"Collision ~Power Type~."

24:06.580 --> 24:07.640
What do I recommend?

24:06.960 --> 24:10.300
Collision
~Power Type~

24:07.640 --> 24:09.800
The convenient option A
with the Blu-ray set!
